# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════     3→#                      ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
     4→#                  Ayam Geprek - Vercel Postgres Setup
     5→# ============================================================================
     6→#                  DATABASE CONNECTION STRINGS (Vercel Postgres - OPTION 1)
     7→# ============================================================================
     8→
     9→# Setelah membuat database di Vercel Postgres, environment variables akan otomatis di-add oleh Vercel
    10→# Anda bisa copy dari Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables
    11→#
    12→# Primary connection string untuk aplikasi (with connection pooling)
    13→POSTGRES_PRISMA_URL="postgres://user:password@host:5432/database?pgbouncer=true&connect_timeout=15"
    14→
    15→# Direct connection (non-pooling) untuk migrations
    16→POSTGRES_URL_NON_POOLING="postgres://user:password@host:5432/database"
    17→
    18→#
    19→# Full connection URL (backup)
    20→#POSTGRES_URL="postgres://user:password@host:5432/database?pgbouncer=true"
    21→#
    22→# ============================================================================
    23→# AUTHENTICATION
    24→# ============================================================================
    25→#
    26→# Secret key untuk NextAuth.js authentication
    27→# Generate dengan: openssl rand -base64 32
    28→# Atau kunjungi: https://generate-secret.vercel.app/32
    29→# Local: http://localhost:3000
    30→# Production: https://your-domain.vercel.app
    31→#
    32→# ============================================================================
    33→# OPTIONAL: PRISMA ACCELERATE
    34→# ============================================================================
    35→#
    36→# Prisma Accelerate untuk global edge caching
    37→# Jika ingin menggunakannya, tambahkan ini variable dari Prisma Dashboard
    38→# PRISMA_ACCELERATE_URL="prisma+postgres://accelerate.prisma-data.net/?api_key=..."
    39→#
    40→# ============================================================================
    41→# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (SQLite Backup)
    42→ # ============================================================================
    43→#
    44→# Jika ingin menggunakan SQLite untuk local development
    45→# DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
    46→#
    47→# ============================================================================
    48→# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
    49→ # ============================================================================
    50→#
    51→ # OPTION 1: Create Vercel Postgres & Auto-Setup (RECOMMENDED)
    52→ # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    53→ # Run deployment script:
    #   bash fix-vercel-db.sh
    # 
    # # Script akan:
    #   - Create Vercel Postgres database (prefix: ayamgeprekku)
    #   - Add environment variables otomatis
    #   - Generate NEXTAUTH_SECRET baru
    #   - Sync database schema
    # #
    # # Total waktu: 10-15 menit
    # #
    # # OPTION 2: Manual via Vercel Dashboard
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # 1. Buka: https://vercel.com/dashboard
    # 2. Import repository GitHub: safir2310/ayamgeprekku
    # 3. Create database: Storage → Create Database → Postgres
    # 4. Prefix: ayamgeprekku
    # 5. Add NEXTAUTH_SECRET (openssl rand -base64 32)
    # 6. Deploy
    # 7. Set NEXTAUTH_URL ke production URL setelah deploy
    # #
    # # OPTION 3: Manual Setup (Prisma Cloud - Current)
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Jika ingin tetap gunakan Prisma Cloud (db.prisma.io:5432)
    # Tidak perlu perubahan - connection string sudah ada di .env
    # #
    # # Notes:
    # - Database connection: db.prisma.io:5432
    # - Schema sudah ter-sync
    # - Database tables sudah ada
    # # Cukup add NEXTAUTH_SECRET di Vercel Dashboard
    # #
    # # OPTION 4: Local Development dengan SQLite
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Jika ingin menggunakan SQLite untuk local development:
    # DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
    # #
    # # ============================================================================
    # DATABASE INFORMATION
    # ============================================================================
    # #
    # OPTION 1: Vercel Postgres (RECOMMENDED)
    #   - Provider: Vercel Postgres
    #   - Region: Singapore (sin1) - Recommended untuk user Indonesia
    #   - Database: ayamgeprekku-verceldb
    #   - Connection: SSL enabled
    #   - Pooling: Enabled (via pgbouncer)
    #   - Environment: Otomatis di Vercel
    # #
    # OPTION 2: Prisma Cloud (Current)
    #   - Provider: Prisma Cloud
    #   - Host: db.prisma.io:5432
    #   - Database: ayamgeprekku
    #   - Connection: Already configured
    #   - Schema: Already synced
    #   - Tables: All tables created
    # #
    # OPTION 3: SQLite (Local Development)
    #   - Provider: SQLite
    #   - File: ./dev.db
    #   - Purpose: Local development only
    #   - Not for production
    #
    # ============================================================================
    # NEXTAUTH_SECRET
    # ============================================================================
    # #
    # Generate dengan: openssl rand -base64 32
    # #
    # # Local: openssl rand -base64 32
    # # Online: https://generate-secret.vercel.app/32
    # #
    # Vercel Dashboard: Settings → Environment Variables → Add New
    #   Name: NEXTAUTH_SECRET
    #   Value: Paste generated secret
    #   Environments: Production, Preview, Development
    #
    # ============================================================================
    # NEXTAUTH_URL
    # # #
    # Local: http://localhost:3000
    # # Production: https://ayamgeprekku.vercel.app
    #
    # Vercel Dashboard: Settings → Environment Variables
    #   Name: NEXTAUTH_URL
    #   Value: Production URL Anda
    #   Environments: Production, Preview, Development
    #
    # ============================================================================
    # TROUBLESHOOTING
    # ============================================================================
    # #
    # Error: "NEXTAUTH_URL is not configured"
    # Solution: NEXTAUTH_URL belum di-set di Vercel Environment Variables
    #           Setelah deploy, update dengan production URL
    #
    # Error: "Database connection failed"
    # Solution: Cek environment variables di Vercel Dashboard
    #           Pastikan semua database variables ada dan benar
    #           Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables
    #           Storage tab untuk cek database status
    # #
    # Error: "NEXTAUTH_SECRET is invalid"
    # Solution: Generate secret dengan: openssl rand -base64 32
    #           Gunakan secret yang cukup panjang (min 32 characters)
    #           Tidak gunakan default atau short secrets
    # #
    # Error: "Project not found"
    # Solution: Import project ke Vercel: https://vercel.com/new
    #           Pastikan nama project cocok
    #
    # ============================================================================
    # PRISMA ACCELERATE
    # ============================================================================
    # #
    # Jika ingin gunakan Prisma Accelerate untuk global edge caching:
    # 1. Buka: https://vercel.com/dashboard
    # 2. Settings → Integrations → Add Integration
# 3. Pilih Prisma Accelerate
# 4. Configure: Auto-generate tokens
# 5. Add POSTGRES_ACCELERATE_URL ke environment variables
# #
    # ============================================================================
